{
  "title": "Internet Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "VPC와 인터넷을 연결하는 게이트웨이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Internet Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#vpc-attachment\">VPC Attachment</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#ipv4-public-address\">IPv4 Public Address</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#ipv6-routing\">IPv6 Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#egress-only-internet-gateway\">Egress-only Internet Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#internet-access-troubleshooting\">Internet Access Troubleshooting</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>29 / 62</span></div><h1>Internet Gateway</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 5 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Internet Gateway는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>와 인터넷 사이에서 Route의 Target이 되는 관리형 Gateway다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>가 가용성과 확장성을 관리하므로 사용자가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Router를 여러 대 운영할 필요가 없다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#ipv4-public-address\">IPv4 Public Address</a> 통신에서는 Private IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>와 Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 사이의 매핑도 수행한다. 리소스가 인터넷과 연결되려면 Gateway 연결, Route, 주소, 보안 허용 조건이 모두 맞아야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"IPv4와 IPv6 인터넷 연결\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>IPv4와 IPv6 인터넷 연결</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>IPv4</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Private IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span></strong><small>Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">EIP</a> 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Internet Gateway</strong><small>주소 변환·인터넷 경로</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Internet</strong><small>보안 규칙도 허용해야 함</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>IPv6 outbound only</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span></strong><small>IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> 주소 사용</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#egress-only-internet-gateway\">Egress-only Internet Gateway</a></strong><small>외부에서 시작하는 연결 제한</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Internet</strong><small>IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> Outbound와 응답</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> Outbound-only에는 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 다른 Gateway를 사용한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"vpc-attachment\"><h2>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Attachment<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#vpc-attachment\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Internet Gateway를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>에 연결한 뒤 Subnet <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>에 경로를 만든다. 연결만 하고 Route를 만들지 않으면 Subnet은 인터넷을 향해 패킷을 보내지 못한다. Gateway는 Subnet의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>처럼 리소스별 허용 규칙을 갖지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ipv4-public-address\"><h2>IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> Public Address<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#ipv4-public-address\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에는 Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a>가 필요하다. Private IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>만 있는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#public-subnet\">Public Subnet</a>에 있어도 Internet Gateway로 인터넷 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 통신을 직접 할 수 없다. Private 자원의 Outbound에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a>를 사용한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ipv6-routing\"><h2>IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#ipv6-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>인터넷으로 라우팅 가능한 IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> 주소와 ::/0 Route를 구성하면 IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> 인터넷 통신이 가능하다. Inbound를 제한하려면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a>을 설정한다. IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> 주소는 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>와 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 매핑을 전제로 하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"egress-only-internet-gateway\"><h2>Egress-only Internet Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#egress-only-internet-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span>에서 내부가 시작한 인터넷 연결과 그 응답만 허용하는 별도 Gateway다. 외부에서 새 연결을 시작할 수 없도록 한다. IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a>와 목적은 비슷하지만 IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> 주소를 변환하는 장치가 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"internet-access-troubleshooting\"><h2>Internet Access Troubleshooting<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#internet-access-troubleshooting\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>, Public Address, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a>을 차례로 확인한다. OS Firewall과 서비스 Listen Address도 필요하다. Gateway만 존재한다고 애플리케이션이 인터넷에 자동으로 공개되지는 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Public <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>가 인터넷 요청을 받고 Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>에 전달하는 구성에서는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>마다 Public IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>를 붙일 필요가 없다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>IGW만 붙인 프라이빗 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 인스턴스는 인터넷에서 직접 연결되지 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/VPC_Internet_Gateway.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/userguide/VPC_Internet_Gateway.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q009\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q010\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q017\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q083\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet&#x27;s route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q011\" data-question=\"Q011\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q011</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q011/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs in two Availability Zones and uses zonal public NAT gateways. If one AZ fails, workloads in the surviving AZ must retain outbound internet access. Which NAT design should the architect use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a single NAT gateway in AZ A</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy a NAT gateway in each AZ and route each subnet to its local NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach one Elastic IP to both AZs simultaneously</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 경로는 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 의존을 제거하고 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 트래픽도 줄인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">이전 용어 <b>IAM</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/\">다음 용어 <b>Kinesis Data Streams</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
